; cluster for all oscillation and wave quantities: periodic, repeating motion.
; frequency, period, amplitude are universal across all oscillating systems —
; mechanical, electrical, optical, quantum.
; connects to math-varga: Fourier analysis, harmonic series are mathematical structure.
; units: frequency in hertz (1/s); period in seconds; amplitude in domain units
; sangati roots

(kosha oscillation-varga
  (vishesa physics-varga math-varga)
  (swarupa subanta spanda)
  (matra hertz second)
  (yukta taranga spanda-matra kaala avrti))
